{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">香港專業教育學院(IVE)青衣分校有貨倉起火，約500人疏散，無人受傷。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">現場有建築材料起火，一度冒出濃煙。警方指上午近11時接報，香港專業教育學院青衣分校貨倉起火。消防到場開喉灌救，將火救熄，約500人自行疏散，無人受傷。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.FIRE.IVE-1430.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026KzEjBck2tr1788512137.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.FIRE.IVE-1430.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">警方經初步調查，貨倉內建築物料先起火，起因懷疑是有鋰電池在充電期間短路。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-04T09:22:46.598182+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":149,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}